tags: link

A setting of a device: the other entries of Container.devices that the device must have
a direct link to (for example NVLink between two GPUs).

The value is the positions of the other entries in base 10, sorted as integers and
separated by commas. Example: 1,2. The node gives devices whose fact device-links
(0e5751c026e543b2e8ab2eb06099daa1d1e5df47778f7787faab45cdf12fe3a8:513329b19e532424e1702f2197e1bb43f94e230165db90b209e47c01a64f821d) names each other.

With no setting, the device needs no link. The node is bound: it refuses the start if
it has no such devices.

=== formal
class=setting
default=absent: no link
link=0e5751c026e543b2e8ab2eb06099daa1d1e5df47778f7787faab45cdf12fe3a8:513329b19e532424e1702f2197e1bb43f94e230165db90b209e47c01a64f821d
name=link
place=service.container.devices.policies
value=the positions of other entries of Container.devices, base 10, sorted as integers, separated by commas
